// `$ascii"…"` evaluated to a string containing a non-ASCII char. The
// file parses and passes `wcl check` (the value is only known once the
// slot is evaluated); reading the field with `wcl get … oops` fails with
// "interpolated ascii string contains a non-ASCII character", exit 3.

@schemaless name = "café"
@schemaless oops = $ascii"id=${name}"

// expect-exit: 0
// expect-get: oops 3
